{"identity":{"original_title":"Morsels","developers":["Furcula"],"publishers":["Annapurna Interactive"],"release_status":"released","release_date":"2025-11-18","tags":["动作肉鸽","像素画面","动作","黑暗奇幻","卡通"]},"hooks":[{"text":"饥饿小鼠遇见有意识的油脂怪，变身小怪物反抗猫群统治","dimension":"题材","excerpt":"You are a hungry mouse, scrounging for scraps in the sewers, when you meet a magical sentient fatberg who teaches you to transform into a mighty little Morsel. With your new powers, set off to dangerous upper worlds where you battle against the cats' oppressive forces and collect new Morsels, strategically swapping as you go.","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1719040/","label":"证据原文片段"},{"text":"随时切换捕获的Morsel，每只怪物都有独立能力、异常与强化特质","dimension":"玩法","excerpt":"- Fight enemies using your rotating roster of captured Morsels, switching between them at any time - Each Morsel has its own abilities and strengths, and can become afflicted with ailments or boosted with power-ups and quirks","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1719040/","label":"证据原文片段"},{"text":"隐藏奖励关会切换独立画风，并加入意外的玩法变体","dimension":"画风","excerpt":"Multiple hidden bonus levels with unique art styles and surprising gameplay twists","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1719040/","label":"证据原文片段"}],"opinions":[{"text":"怪异视觉风格漂亮","dimension":"画风","source":"鉴赏家观点","polarity":"喜欢","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"A beautifully weird roguelite","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/6856127-Roguelikes/","label":"证据原文片段"}]},{"text":"像素美术令人喜欢","dimension":"画风","source":"玩家观点","polarity":"喜欢","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"I love the pixel art quite a bit","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/Tibore/recommended/1719040/","label":"证据原文片段"}]},{"text":"玩法循环缺少满足感","dimension":"玩法","source":"鉴赏家观点","polarity":"需留意","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"The game loop doesn't feel satisfying","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheDwarfTypaGuy/recommended/1719040?snr=1_5_9__402","label":"证据原文片段"}]},{"text":"系统元素未能形成整体","dimension":"玩法","source":"鉴赏家观点","polarity